  <!-- Toolbar glyphs: Google Material Symbols, Outlined, weight 400 (Apache 2.0), the SVG path
       data from symbols/web/<name>/materialsymbolsoutlined/<name>_24px.svg in
       https://github.com/google/material-design-icons, kept beside this file in gfx/.
       Material draws on a 960-unit grid with y from -960 to 0; IconGrid maps that onto
       24 x 24 px so every glyph keeps its designed size. Nonzero is SVG's fill rule. -->
